<div id="2026-10-24-cssnavigation-project-id" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-10-24 — CSSNavigation worktree maps to project #305</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The CSSNavigation entry in <code>root/config/worktrees.json</code> now has <code>project_id</code> 305 (CSSNAV).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Decision sort only resolves a branch root from that field. The entry had a port and no project, so Sort died with "cannot resolve a root project for branch 'CSSNavigation'".</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/config/worktrees.json</code>.</p>
</div>
